# Format: KEY|required|default|description
GEMINI_API_KEY|required||Gemini API key for professor and librarian
POSTGRES_USER|optional|eduanima|PostgreSQL username
POSTGRES_PASSWORD|optional|eduanima_password|PostgreSQL password
POSTGRES_DB|optional|eduanima_professor|PostgreSQL database name
DATABASE_URL|optional|postgres://eduanima:eduanima_password@localhost:5432/eduanima_professor?sslmode=disable|Professor local database URL
MINIO_ROOT_USER|optional|minioadmin|MinIO root user
MINIO_ROOT_PASSWORD|optional|minioadmin|MinIO root password
MINIO_BUCKET|optional|eduanima-materials|Material bucket name
MINIO_ENDPOINT|optional|localhost:9000|MinIO endpoint
MINIO_USE_SSL|optional|false|MinIO TLS usage flag
OBJECT_STORAGE_BACKEND|optional|minio|Object storage backend
KAFKA_BROKERS|optional|localhost:9094|Kafka broker list
KAFKA_TOPIC_INGEST|optional|eduanima.ingest.jobs|Kafka ingest topic
PORT|optional|8080|Professor HTTP port
LIBRARIAN_GRPC_ADDR|optional|localhost:50051|Librarian gRPC address for professor
PROFESSOR_MODEL_INGESTION|optional|gemini-3.1-flash-lite-preview|Phase 1 OCR/chunk. Realtime API only (no Batch API). OCR errors absorbed by vector search. Do NOT use for other phases.
PROFESSOR_MODEL_PLAN|optional|gemini-3-flash|Phase 2 planning. Called once per request. Accuracy over cost. Upgrade to pro for graduate-level content.
PROFESSOR_MODEL_ANSWER|optional|gemini-3-flash|Phase 4 answer with Blob input. Upgrade to gemini-3.1-pro-preview if formula/figure quality insufficient. Pro: minimal thinking unavailable.
GRPC_PORT|optional|50051|Librarian gRPC port
LIBRARIAN_HEALTH_PORT|optional|8081|Librarian HTTP health/ready port
LIBRARIAN_MODEL_SEARCH|optional|gemini-3-flash|Phase 3 search agent. Cost-optimized alt: Flash Lite for 3-A only with thinking_level=medium.
PROFESSOR_THINKING_INGESTION|optional|minimal|Phase 1. minimal stabilizes ---CHUNK--- delimiter compliance. Higher levels may cause format drift.
PROFESSOR_THINKING_PLAN|optional|medium|Phase 2. medium for intent analysis. Flash default is high - must be set explicitly to avoid cost overrun.
LIBRARIAN_THINKING_PLAN|optional|low|Phase 3-A query generation all loops. low preserves output diversity for query generation.
LIBRARIAN_THINKING_EVALUATE|optional|low|Phase 3-B sufficiency evaluation mid-loops. low for speed/cost balance.
LIBRARIAN_THINKING_EVALUATE_FINAL|optional|medium|Phase 3-B sufficiency evaluation final loop only. medium for false-positive prevention.
PROFESSOR_THINKING_ANSWER|optional|low|Phase 4. low avoids TTFT degradation (1.5-2x delay at medium+). Pro users: minimal unavailable, low is minimum.
LIBRARIAN_MAX_LOOPS|optional|3|Librarian maximum reasoning loops per request
LIBRARIAN_MAX_RESULTS|optional|10|Librarian maximum evidence results per request
LIBRARIAN_TIMEOUT_MS|optional|30000|Librarian timeout per request in milliseconds
LOG_LEVEL|optional|info|Global log level
API_BASE_URL|optional|http://localhost:8080/api|Web server-side Professor API base URL
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL|optional|http://localhost:8080/api|Web browser-side Professor API base URL
